      "description": "Note: Alarm durations and MTTR are not calculated as the source EAP system currently does not broadcast explicit alarm-clear events. Only occurrence times are logged. Duration estimation requires EAP team confirmation of clear/reset event availability. Count of alarms with alarm_type='Critical' in the last 5 minutes.",
